{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q43177","formula":"C₅₅H₇₂MgN₄O₅","hill":"C55H72MgN4O5","elements":["H","C","N","O","Mg"],"composition":{"C":55.0,"H":72.0,"N":4.0,"O":5.0,"Mg":1.0},"names":{"en":"Chlorophyll","ru":"Хлорофилл","uk":"Хлорофіл"},"descriptions":{"en":"Chlorophyll is any of several related photochemical catalysts and green pigments found in cyanobacteria and in the chloroplasts of algae and plants. Its name is derived from the Greek words χλωρός (khloros, \"pale green\") and φύλλον (phyllon, \"leaf\"). Chlorophyll allows plants to absorb energy from light.","ru":"Хлорофи́лл (от греч. χλωρός, «зелёный» и φύλλον, «лист») — зелёный пигмент, окрашивающий хлоропласты растений в зелёный цвет. При его участии происходит фотосинтез.","uk":"Хлорофіл — зелений пігмент, наявний у клітинах рослин, деяких водоростей і ціанобактерій, що надає їм відповідного кольору. Назва походить від грец. chloros — «зелений» і phyllon — «листок»."},"fame":99,"pubchemCid":null,"mass":null,"charge":0,"smiles":"C1=2N3C(C=C4[N+]5=C(C=C6N7C8=C(C9=[N+](C(=C1)[C@H]([C@@H]9CCC(OC/C=C(/CCC[C@@H](CCC[C@@H](CCCC(C)C)C)C)\\C)=O)C)[Mg-2]735)[C@H](C(C8=C6C)=O)C(=O)OC)C(=C4*)*)=C(C2*)*","inchikey":null,"iupac":null,"classes":[{"qid":"Q55640599","names":{"en":"group of chemical entities","ru":"группа химических сущностей"}}],"structureInfo":null,"structure":null,"sources":[{"role":"identity","name":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q43177","license":"CC0 1.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (en)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chlorophyll","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (ru)","url":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%A5%D0%BB%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%BE%D1%84%D0%B8%D0%BB%D0%BB","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (uk)","url":"https://uk.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%A5%D0%BB%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%BE%D1%84%D1%96%D0%BB","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"photo","name":"Wikimedia Commons","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/F